{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20323","headline":"新桃行 · 张籍","name":"新桃行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃生叶婆娑，枝叶四向多。\n高未出墙颠，蒿苋相凌摩。\n植之三年余，今年初试花。\n秋来已成实，其阴良已嘉。\n青蝉不来鸣，安得迅羽过。\n常恶牵丝虫，蒙幂成网罗。\n顾托戏儿童，勿折吾柔柯。\n明年结其实，磊磊充汝家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}